foodpanda announced delivery from 43 Sheng Siong outlets with more than 12,000 products and a stated one-hour delivery proposition. It described the supermarket as exclusive to its on-demand channel and planned more outlets progressively.","implication":"Compare retailer partnership economics with owned inventory in GoMart.","nextAction":"Validate actual outlets, fill rates, substitutions, picking responsibility and contribution per order.","url":"https://www.foodpanda.com/newsroom/foodpanda-launches-sheng-siong-partnership-with-s280000-in-total-giveaways/","source":"foodpanda newsroom","limitations":"Announced scope is not a verified operating census; contract duration and terms are undisclosed."},{"id":"capital-grab-foodpanda-taiwan-20260323","date":"2026-03-23","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Grab proposes $600m purchase of foodpanda Taiwan","summary":"Grab agreed to buy the Taiwan delivery business; its 12 October statement still calls the acquisition proposed.","implication":"Treat regulatory feasibility and merchant migration as core deal work, alongside valuation.","nextAction":"TFTC decision, merchant retention, rider migration, incentives and integration timing.","url":"https://www.grab.com/sg/press/others/grab-to-acquire-delivery-heros-foodpanda-delivery-business-in-taiwan/","source":"Grab","limitations":"Do not count Taiwan as an already completed Grab operating expansion or imply global foodpanda ownership transfer."}]}